# 22x80 after a mock run, as amended by the owner's directive of 2026-09-23: there is no post-run hand-off left — the mark was committed to
# the scrollback before the task, and no frame after `end` or on the first key draws it in the dynamic region (the strip keeps the rule, F-W5)
expect \x1b\[\?25l
expect Say hi
expect sess \$
sleep 0.3
send fix the failing test
sleep 0.2
send \r
expect step \d+/\d+
expect finished [·-] (complete|max_steps|generator_done)
expect Follow-up, question
sleep 0.5
mark ended
send h
expect (?:›|>) (?:\x1b\[[0-9;]*m)*h
sleep 0.3
mark keyed
send \x03
expect Follow-up, question
send /exit
sleep 0.2
send \r
eof
